msgstr "未启用任何登录方式"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:326
msgid "Start and Stop live only here: they act on fewer states than Startup and Shutdown, so they do not earn a place in the strip."
msgstr "“开始”和“停止”仅在此处提供：它们作用的状态比“启动”和“关机”更少，因此不值得在工具栏中占一席之地。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:334
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{label} — an action on {name} is running; this can take a moment"
msgstr "{label} — 正在对 {name} 执行操作；可能需要一点时间"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:335
#, python-brace-format
msgid "{label} — an action on {name} is running"
msgstr "{label} — 正在对 {name} 执行操作"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:488
msgid "Startup"
msgstr "启动"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:492
msgid "End maintenance so the server is scheduled again"
msgstr "结束维护，使服务器重新纳入调度"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:494
msgid "On by default, exactly like Discord's /server startup. An unflagged server simply stays unflagged."
msgstr "默认开启，与 Discord 的 /server startup 完全一致。未被标记的服务器就保持未标记。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:496
msgid "Startup — bring this server up from SHUTDOWN"
msgstr "启动 — 让此服务器从“已关闭”状态启动"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:497
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Startup server {server}"
msgstr "启动服务器 {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:498
msgid "It comes back up and rejoins the rotation: with the box below ticked (the default) any maintenance is ended, so the scheduler may start it again. A server that was not in maintenance simply stays that way. This is the DCS-level bring-up, not the process-level Start in the row's menu."
msgstr "它会重新启动并加入轮换：勾选下方复选框（默认）会结束任何维护，从而让调度器可以再次启动它。本来就不在维护中的服务器则保持不变。这是 DCS 层面的启动，而不是该行菜单里进程层面的“开始”。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:503
msgid "Start up server"
msgstr "启动服务器"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:504
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Start up {server} — ends maintenance so the scheduler may start it"
msgstr "启动 {server} — 结束维护，让调度器可以启动它"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:506
msgid "Start"
msgstr "开始"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:509
msgid "Start — start a STOPPED server"
msgstr "开始 — 让一台“已停止”的服务器运行"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:510
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Start server {server}"
msgstr "让服务器 {server} 运行"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:511
msgid "start a STOPPED server — Startup is the usual one"
msgstr "让一台“已停止”的服务器运行 — 通常用的是“启动”"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:513
msgid "Pause"
msgstr "暂停"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:515
msgid "Pause — freeze the mission; players stay connected"
msgstr "暂停 — 冻结任务；玩家保持连接"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:516
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Pause the mission on {server}"
msgstr "暂停 {server} 上的任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:518
msgid "Unpause"
msgstr "继续"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:520
msgid "Unpause — resume the frozen mission"
msgstr "继续 — 恢复已冻结的任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:521
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Unpause the mission on {server}"
msgstr "继续 {server} 上的任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:523
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1017
msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:527
msgid "Restart — players currently flying lose their sortie"
msgstr "重启 — 正在飞行的玩家会失去本轮出击"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:528
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart server {server}"
msgstr "重启服务器 {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:529
msgid "<b>Players currently flying lose their sortie.</b> The mission restarts from the beginning — mid-mission progress is gone."
msgstr "<b>正在飞行的玩家会失去本轮出击。</b>任务将从头重新开始 — 任务进行中的进度会丢失。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:531
msgid "A restart stops the mission, reloads it from the start and the players reconnect to a fresh round. It cannot be undone from here."
msgstr "重启会停止任务，从头重新载入，玩家将重新连接到新的一轮。此操作无法在此撤销。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:533
msgid "Restart server"
msgstr "重启服务器"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:534
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Restart {server} — players flying lose their sortie"
msgstr "重启 {server} — 飞行中的玩家会失去本轮出击"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:536
msgid "Shutdown"
msgstr "关机"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:542
msgid "Set maintenance so the scheduler does not restart it"
msgstr "设为维护状态，以免调度器重启它"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:544
msgid "On by default, exactly like Discord's /server shutdown: without it a scheduled start brings the server straight back."
msgstr "默认开启，与 Discord 的 /server shutdown 完全一致：若不勾选，计划启动会立刻把服务器重新拉起。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:546
msgid "Shutdown — stop the DCS server; everyone on it is disconnected"
msgstr "关机 — 停止 DCS 服务器；上面的所有人都会被断开连接"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:547
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shutdown server {server}"
msgstr "关闭服务器 {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:548
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<b>{players} players are disconnected</b> and nobody can join until somebody starts the server up again. The box below is ticked by default and puts the server into maintenance — it stays out of service, so the scheduler does not bring it back up. Clear it only to shut the server down without keeping it down."
msgstr "<b>{players} 名玩家将被断开</b>，在有人重新启动服务器之前无人能加入。下方复选框默认勾选，会把服务器置为维护状态 — 它保持停止服务，因此调度器不会把它重新拉起。只有在你希望关闭服务器但不想让它保持关闭时才取消勾选。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:553
msgid "It stays SHUTDOWN on every page until a Startup brings it back — this is the graceful stop, not the process-level Stop in the row's menu."
msgstr "它会在所有页面上保持“已关闭”，直到有一次“启动”把它带回来 — 这是优雅停止，而不是该行菜单里进程层面的“停止”。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:556
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1032
msgid "Shut down"
msgstr "关机"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:557
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Shut down {server} — {players} players are disconnected"
msgstr "关闭 {server} — {players} 名玩家将被断开"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:559
msgid "Stop"
msgstr "停止"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:562
msgid "Stop — stop the server process; players are disconnected"
msgstr "停止 — 停止服务器进程；玩家会被断开"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:563
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Stop server {server}"
msgstr "停止服务器 {server}"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:564
msgid "stop the server process — players are disconnected"
msgstr "停止服务器进程 — 玩家会被断开"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:565
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<b>{players} players are disconnected.</b> Stop ends the server process, and nobody can join until a Start brings it back."
msgstr "<b>{players} 名玩家将被断开。</b>“停止”会结束服务器进程，在有一次“开始”把它带回来之前无人能加入。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:567
msgid "This is the process-level pair (Stop/Start), not the DCS-level pair (Shutdown/Startup)."
msgstr "这是进程层面的一对（停止/开始），而不是 DCS 层面的一对（关机/启动）。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:569
msgid "Stop server process"
msgstr "停止服务器进程"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:570
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Stop {server} — {players} players are disconnected"
msgstr "停止 {server} — {players} 名玩家将被断开"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:585
msgid "Maintenance"
msgstr "维护"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:587
msgid "Maintenance — keep this server out of service; the scheduler will not start it"
msgstr "维护 — 让此服务器保持停止服务；调度器不会启动它"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:588
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Put server {server} into maintenance"
msgstr "将服务器 {server} 置于维护状态"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:589
msgid "keep the server out of service — it is not stopped by this"
msgstr "让服务器保持停止服务 — 此操作不会停止它"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:592
msgid "End maintenance"
msgstr "结束维护"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:594
msgid "End maintenance — let the scheduler start this server again"
msgstr "结束维护 — 让调度器可以再次启动此服务器"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:595
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take server {server} out of maintenance"
msgstr "将服务器 {server} 移出维护状态"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:596
msgid "the server may be started again — nothing is started by this"
msgstr "服务器可以再次启动了 — 此操作不会启动任何东西"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:662
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:682
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:552
msgid "Add to the rotation"
msgstr "加入轮换"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:666
msgid "Load it when the server next starts"
msgstr "在服务器下次启动时载入它"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:668
msgid "Arms the rotation so this mission is the next one the server loads."
msgstr "设定轮换，使此任务成为服务器下一个载入的任务。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:672
msgid "Load it now"
msgstr "立即载入"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:674
msgid "Loads it right away — only honoured while the server is running, paused or stopped."
msgstr "立即载入 — 仅在服务器处于运行、暂停或停止状态时生效。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:679
msgid "This mission is already on the server: adding it changes the ROTATION LIST only. No file is copied and nothing is deleted — that is what Upload does."
msgstr "此任务已在服务器上：加入它只会改变轮换列表。不会复制任何文件，也不会删除任何东西 — 那是“上传”做的事。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:683
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Add the mission to {server}'s rotation list"
msgstr "将任务加入 {server} 的轮换列表"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:689
msgid "Remove"
msgstr "移除"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:693
msgid "Also delete the mission file from disk"
msgstr "同时从磁盘删除任务文件"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:695
msgid "Removes the primary file, its .dcssb copy and the .orig. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "删除主文件、其 .dcssb 副本和 .orig。此操作无法撤销。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:700
msgid "<b>The mission is removed from the rotation list and stops being loaded.</b> The box below is off by default: with it ticked the mission file itself — the primary, its .dcssb copy and the .orig — is deleted from the server, and that cannot be undone."
msgstr "<b>该任务将从轮换列表中移除，不再被载入。</b>下方复选框默认关闭：勾选后，任务文件本身 — 主文件、其 .dcssb 副本和 .orig — 会从服务器上删除，且无法撤销。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:704
msgid "Removing it from the list changes the rotation only; the file stays on the server unless you tick the box. Discord's /mission delete asks the same two questions."
msgstr "将其从列表中移除只会改变轮换；除非你勾选该复选框，文件会保留在服务器上。Discord 的 /mission delete 会问同样的两个问题。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:707
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:3946
msgid "Remove mission"
msgstr "移除任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:708
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Remove the mission from {server}'s rotation list"
msgstr "从 {server} 的轮换列表中移除该任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:710
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:533
msgid "Load"
msgstr "载入"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:715
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:610
msgid "Upload mission"
msgstr "上传任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:730
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:750
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:3951
msgid "Remove missions"
msgstr "移除任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:734
msgid "Also delete the mission files from disk"
msgstr "同时从磁盘删除任务文件"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:736
msgid "Removes the primary file, its .dcssb copy and the .orig of EVERY selected mission. This cannot be undone. Left OFF, the mission only leaves the rotation — and while the server's mission auto-scan is on, a mission file left on disk is re-added to the list, so the removal is not permanent."
msgstr "删除每一个所选任务的主文件、其 .dcssb 副本和 .orig。此操作无法撤销。若保持关闭，任务只会离开轮换 — 而当服务器的任务自动扫描开启时，留在磁盘上的任务文件会被重新加入列表，因此移除并非永久性的。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:744
msgid "<b>The selected missions are removed from the rotation list and stop being loaded.</b> The box below is off by default: with it ticked the mission files themselves are deleted from the server, and that cannot be undone."
msgstr "<b>所选任务将从轮换列表中移除，不再被载入。</b>下方复选框默认关闭：勾选后，任务文件本身会从服务器上删除，且无法撤销。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:748
msgid "The chosen missions leave the rotation list; their files stay on the server unless you tick the box."
msgstr "所选任务会离开轮换列表；除非你勾选该复选框，它们的文件会保留在服务器上。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:751
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Remove the selected missions from {server}'s rotation list"
msgstr "从 {server} 的轮换列表中移除所选任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:755
msgid "Move"
msgstr "移动"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:769
#: services/webservice/templates/server_detail.html:443
msgid "Set as start"
msgstr "设为起始任务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:870
msgid "Kick"
msgstr "踢出"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:872
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:888
msgid "Reason"
msgstr "原因"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:873
msgid "Shown to the player in game."
msgstr "在游戏内显示给该玩家。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:875
msgid "Kick — disconnected now; they may rejoin immediately"
msgstr "踢出 — 立即断开连接；他们可以马上重新加入"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:876
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Kick {player} from {server}"
msgstr "将 {player} 从 {server} 踢出"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:877
msgid "disconnected now — a kick is not a ban"
msgstr "立即断开连接 — 踢出不是封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:878
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<b>{player} is disconnected from {server} now.</b> They can rejoin immediately — a kick is not a ban and leaves no block behind."
msgstr "<b>{player} 现在已被从 {server} 断开。</b>他们可以马上重新加入 — 踢出不是封禁，不会留下任何封禁记录。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:880
msgid "A kick ends their session; it blocks nothing and expires with it. Nothing is written to the ban list, so they may be back in the air in a minute."
msgstr "踢出会结束他们的会话；它不封禁任何东西，并随会话一同失效。不会写入封禁列表，所以他们可能一分钟后又能起飞。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:883
msgid "Kick player"
msgstr "踢出玩家"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:884
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Kick {player} from {server} — they may rejoin immediately"
msgstr "将 {player} 从 {server} 踢出 — 他们可以马上重新加入"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:886
msgid "Ban"
msgstr "封禁"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:889
