#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1078
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1102
msgid "Take servers offline"
msgstr "让服务器下线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1081
msgid "Also mark them as maintenance"
msgstr "同时将它们标记为维护"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1083
msgid "On by default: without it a scheduled start can bring the servers back while the node is \"offline\"."
msgstr "默认开启：不勾选的话，计划启动可能会在节点“离线”期间把服务器重新拉起。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1085
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take the servers on {node} offline?"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器下线？"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1086
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take servers offline — every server on {node} that is up is marked as maintenance and stopped; its players are disconnected, while the node's services stay up"
msgstr "让服务器下线 — {node} 上每一台正在运行的服务器都会被标记为维护并停止；其玩家会被断开，而节点的服务保持不变"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1089
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take the servers on {node} out of service"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器停止服务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1090
msgid "marks the node's servers as maintenance and stops them"
msgstr "将节点的服务器标记为维护并停止它们"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1091
#, python-brace-format
msgid "<b>{servers} server(s) on {node} go down and {players} player(s) are disconnected.</b> The box below is ticked by default and marks those servers as maintenance — leave it ticked unless you mean to let a scheduled start bring them back while the node is \"offline\"."
msgstr "<b>{node} 上的 {servers} 台服务器将下线，{players} 名玩家将被断开。</b>下方复选框默认勾选，会把这些服务器标记为维护 — 除非你想让计划启动在节点“离线”期间把它们带回来，否则请保持勾选。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1095
msgid "Only the SERVERS on the node change. The node itself keeps running, so its services — including this console — stay up, and bringing the node back is a job this browser CAN do. With the box ticked the servers are flagged as maintenance before they stop, so they stay out of service until somebody ends that; clear the box and no flag is written at all — the servers stop and nothing keeps the scheduler from starting them again."
msgstr "改变的只有该节点上的服务器。节点本身继续运行，因此它的服务 — 包括此控制台 — 保持在线，把节点带回来是此浏览器可以完成的工作。勾选复选框后，服务器在停止前会被标记为维护，因此它们会保持停止服务，直到有人结束该状态；取消勾选则不写入任何标记 — 服务器会停止，且没有任何东西阻止调度器再次启动它们。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1103
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Take {node} offline — {servers} server(s) go down, {players} player(s) are disconnected"
msgstr "让 {node} 下线 — {servers} 台服务器将下线，{players} 名玩家将被断开"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1110
#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1126
msgid "Bring servers online"
msgstr "让服务器上线"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1112
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring the servers on {node} back online?"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器重新上线？"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1113
msgid "Bring servers online — clear the maintenance flags this node's power-off set and start the servers it stopped; a flag set by hand is left alone"
msgstr "让服务器上线 — 清除该节点下线时设置的维护标记，并启动它停止的服务器；手动设置的标记则保持不动"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1115
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring the servers on {node} back into service"
msgstr "让 {node} 上的服务器恢复服务"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1116
msgid "ends the maintenance this node's power-off set, and starts what it stopped"
msgstr "结束该节点下线时设置的维护，并启动它停止的服务器"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1118
msgid "This reverts EXACTLY the last power-off on this node: it clears only the maintenance flags that operation set and starts only the servers it stopped. A flag somebody set by hand is never cleared, and a server that is still in maintenance is never started. If the bot has restarted since the power-off the record is gone, and this then starts every server that is down and not in maintenance, clearing no flag at all — the message says which of the two happened. The node's services were never touched."
msgstr "此操作会精确地撤销该节点上一次的下线：它只清除该操作设置的维护标记，并且只启动它停止的服务器。有人手动设置的标记绝不会被清除，仍处于维护的服务器绝不会被启动。如果自那次下线以来机器人已经重启，记录就没了，此时它会启动每一台处于下线且不在维护的服务器，且不清除任何标记 — 消息会说明发生的是这两种情况中的哪一种。节点的服务从未被触碰。"

#: services/webservice/pages/actions.py:1127
#, python-brace-format
msgid "Bring {node} online — the flags its power-off set are cleared, what it stopped is started"
msgstr "让 {node} 上线 — 清除其下线时设置的标记，启动它停止的服务器"

